  ('CHM 211', 'General Physical Chemistry', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Physics and Astronomy', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'Elective. Gases and Thermodynamics: Molecular collisions in gases, virial equation, critical phenomena, and reduced properties. Chemical thermodynamics, detailed treatment of the first law of thermodynamics, and the Carnot cycle. Chemical Kinetics: Integrated rate equations for second and third order reactions, reaction mechanisms, rate laws, and the effect of temperature on reaction rates.

Prerequisite: CHM 112', '["Gases and Thermodynamics: Molecular collisions in gases, virial equation, critical phenomena, and reduced properties. Chemical thermodynamics, detailed treatment of the first law of thermodynamics, and the Carnot cycle", "Chemical Kinetics: Integrated rate equations for second and third order reactions, reaction mechanisms, rate laws, and the effect of temperature on reaction rates"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Physics and Astronomy course module'),
  ('GLG 211', 'Crystallography', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Physics and Astronomy', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'Elective. Formation of crystal; crystalline state; laws of crystallography; space lattice and unit cell symmetry elements, goniometry and stereographic projection; crystallographic projection; crystallographic notations; seven crystal systems and 32 classes of crystal symmetry, crystal defects; twinning and twin laws. Principles of crystal chemistry; physical and determinative properties of minerals; systematics of minerals; silicates; description of common rock-forming minerals. Industrial Mineralogy.', '["Formation of crystal", "Crystalline state", "Laws of crystallography", "Space lattice and unit cell symmetry elements, goniometry and stereographic projection", "Crystallographic projection", "Crystallographic notations", "Seven crystal systems and 32 classes of crystal symmetry, crystal defects", "Twinning and twin laws", "Principles of crystal chemistry", "Physical and determinative properties of minerals", "Systematics of minerals", "Silicates", "Description of common rock-forming minerals", "Industrial Mineralogy"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Physics and Astronomy course module'),
  ('STA 203', 'Statistics for Physical Sciences and Engineering I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Physics and Astronomy', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'Elective. Initial steps in planning of biological experiments. Methods of data collection, presentation and analysis. Measures of central tendency and dispersion. Frequency distributions. Elementary probability. Discrete and continuous distributions: Binomial, Poisson, Normal and exponential distributions. Interval estimation.', '["Initial steps in planning of biological experiments", "Methods of data collection, presentation and analysis", "Measures of central tendency and dispersion", "Frequency distributions", "Elementary probability", "Discrete and continuous distributions: Binomial, Poisson, Normal and exponential distributions", "Interval estimation"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Physics and Astronomy course module'),
