  ('MTH 222', 'Elementary Differential Equations I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Physics and Astronomy', '300 Level', 'second', 3, 'Elective. First-order ordinary differential equations. Existence and uniqueness of solution. Second-order ordinary differential equations with constant coefficients. General theory of $n$th-order linear ordinary differential equations. The Laplace transform. Solution of initial- and boundary-value problems by Laplace transform method. Simple treatment of partial differential equations in two independent variables. Applications of ordinary and partial differential equations to physical, life and engineering problems.', '["First-order ordinary differential equations", "Existence and uniqueness of solution", "Second-order ordinary differential equations with constant coefficients", "General theory of $n$th-order linear ordinary differential equations", "The Laplace transform", "Solution of initial- and boundary-value problems by Laplace transform method", "Simple treatment of partial differential equations in two independent variables", "Applications of ordinary and partial differential equations to physical, life and engineering problems"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Physics and Astronomy course module'),
